<p>Presence of 1 major criterion, either number 1 or 2</p>
<p>Presence of major criterion number 3 and at least 2 minor criteria</p>
<p>Includes clinically/biochemically diagnosed disorders like Blomstrand and Eiken chondrodysplasia, PHP type 1 and 2, PPHP, AHO, POH, and acrodysostosis</p>
</td>
