                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD1</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Loss-of-function mutation in <italic toggle="yes">PTH1R</italic> causing Blomstrand and Eiken chondrodysplasia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD2</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Genetically confirmed disorders like PHP1A, PHP1C, PPHP, and POH due to loss-of-function mutation in Gs&#x003b1;</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD3</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Methylation changes at&#x000a0;1 or more <italic toggle="yes">GNAS</italic> DMRs, associated with or without a genetic (deletion) or cytogenetic (UPD) defect causing PHP1B</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD4</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Acrodysostosis type 1 with/without <italic toggle="yes">PRKAR1A</italic> mutation</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD5</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Acrodysostosis type 2 with/without <italic toggle="yes">PDE4D</italic> mutation</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSD6</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Autosomal dominant hypertension with brachydactyly with/without <italic toggle="yes">PDE3A</italic> mutation</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 163.625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>iPPSDx</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 1054.390625px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Absence of genetic/epigenetic defects identified following molecular investigation of known genes described above</p>
</td>
              </tr>
